    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>Establishing a 1,509-megawatt (MW) natural gas fired IPP in Ibri, Oman at a total cost of SAR 3.683 billion. Natural gas will is the primary fuel for electricity generation, with fuel oil used as a back-up option.</p>\r\n",
